The sinden-driver binaries
--------------------------

The packages built here contain a `sinden-driver` binary. That binary is
NOT part of this repository: it is built from a separate, private source
tree, published as an asset of this repository's `driver-v*` releases, and
downloaded at build time by `scripts/fetch-driver` (pinned by version and
SHA-256 in `driver.lock`).

The `sinden-driver` binary is distributed under its own terms, which are
not the MIT License of this repository. Redistributing it requires the
terms that accompany its release. Until those terms are published with the
release, all rights to the binary are reserved by its copyright holder.

